An add official Social Buttons using floating sidebar (Facebook,Twitter,Linkedin,Google+,Pinterest)

== Description ==

= "wp-social-buttons" = is the very simple plugin to add official social share/like buttons.
 
Using offical social share/like buttons,you can share your website easily with your friends on Facebook,Twitter,Linkedin,Pinterest,Google+.
 
There are not added any external JS files except social API files in this plugin so it's does not effect on your site speed as well.


 **[Upgrade to Pro Version](https://rgaddons.wordpress.com/wp-social-buttons-pro/?utm_source=wordpress.org&utm_medium=free-plugin&utm_campaign=wpsocial)**


= Features = 
* Floating Sidebar
* An options to show/hide the social buttons
* An options to define the postion(Left/Right) of floating sidebar
* An option To Disabe For Mobile

= Pro Features = 

* Social Share Buttons
* An option to hide "Floating Sidebar" on page/post/product/categoyr/archive pages 
* An option to define distance of sidebar from left/right/bottom
* An option to hide "Social Share Buttons" on page/post/product/categoyr/archive pages 
* An option to define position of "Social Share Buttons" (bottom/above of content)
* An option to set floating sidebar position to horizontal automaticaly for mobile users
* An option to define "Sidebar Backgroung Color" 
* An option to disable "Show/Hide" buttons of sidebar
* An option to define your message (show/hide)
* Show/Hide "Social Share Buttons" and "Floating Sidebar" on any specific pages:
* An options to define the postion(Left/Right/Bottom) of floating sidebar
* Extra Buttons (Tumblr, Buffer, StumbleUpon, Print, Email, Youtube)
* An option for set feature image as pinterest share image


